                        "source_sense_id": "9e73efca-c920-30a9-b579-e8a6d2284528",
                        "target_lang_word": "demonic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "demonic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1e0caff-b733-3e67-849c-25b2f533b04c",
                                        "entry_id": "e04167e7-6307-34fc-be8f-460767016312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to demons or evil spirits; demoniac."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7156f4e9-70b3-4afc-aea1-edade747b108",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e0caff-b733-3e67-849c-25b2f533b04c",
                                                "text": "Convinced that his uncle was a warlock, he rifled through his attic, looking for demonic artifacts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "813395ee-96e5-4a42-982e-c41270de4dd5",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e0caff-b733-3e67-849c-25b2f533b04c",
                                                "text": "Once he had grasped the controls, he unleashed a demonic laugh that made his hostages shudder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1419110a-7da1-3e43-a4c0-0ce8b7d33d50",
                                        "entry_id": "e04167e7-6307-34fc-be8f-460767016312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to daemons in ancient Greek thought; concerning supernatural ‘genius’."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd37937-2c89-4418-92d0-be7ad7b87bc8",
                                                "sense_id": "1419110a-7da1-3e43-a4c0-0ce8b7d33d50",
                                                "text": "Aristotle concedes that the nature of the dream is indeed daemonic [translating dämonischer], but not divine – which might well reveal a profound meaning, if one could hit on the right translation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9677faae-ea53-3cc8-a287-ae93990b5586",
                                        "entry_id": "e04167e7-6307-34fc-be8f-460767016312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremely cruel or evil; abhorrent or repugnant; diabolical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a72125e2-bdd6-49ab-a3f0-38f69d325c0d",
                                                "sense_id": "9677faae-ea53-3cc8-a287-ae93990b5586",
                                                "text": "Lifton goes on to argue that they can commit these demonic acts because they rationalize their behaviour. A whole array of rationalizations justified the murder of innocent men, women and children."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c6304e-f31e-4069-89e6-fe991f109d05",
                                                "sense_id": "9677faae-ea53-3cc8-a287-ae93990b5586",
                                                "text": "Texts show the star prime time host Tucker Carlson calling Mr. Trump a “demonic force,” […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0778ac17-acc1-485f-a072-c0ba19209605",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ac83eca-2511-3f51-8844-b10d7a5a70b2",
                        "source_sense_id": "9e73efca-c920-30a9-b579-e8a6d2284528",
                        "target_lang_word": "satanic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "satanic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85f32346-2360-3ffa-9a11-a3bd86257e00",
                                        "entry_id": "8acd7214-70a7-309c-908d-d6d232eb80c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative letter-case form of Satanic (of, pertaining to or resembling Satan)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7da7f16b-5525-4adc-978f-e85ede0264d7",
                                                "sense_id": "85f32346-2360-3ffa-9a11-a3bd86257e00",
                                                "text": "Black metal is a subgenre of heavy metal music that typically takes on anti-Christian, satanic and pagan themes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a0684a1-d1a9-312c-8371-2fe8da2f5558",
                                        "entry_id": "8acd7214-70a7-309c-908d-d6d232eb80c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Evil, fiendish, devilish or diabolical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4b8cda6-07a9-4d28-9ea6-bfc20a36dcb2",
                                                "sense_id": "5a0684a1-d1a9-312c-8371-2fe8da2f5558",
                                                "text": "Can Abrahamic religious leaders call other religions \"satanic\" without being in jail?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e7e4188-7340-4d1f-ab48-c114805b4c70",
                                                "sense_id": "5a0684a1-d1a9-312c-8371-2fe8da2f5558",
                                                "text": "Instead, the 30-year-old singer's subjects include that modern satanic mill, the call centre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebfa51e-2bd7-4c58-a0e9-a2309c7d58a7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a0684a1-d1a9-312c-8371-2fe8da2f5558",
                                                "text": "The working class just looks different. \"Call centres are the new dark satanic mills. We have people who have to put their hand up to ask to go to the toilet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb4ec903-d27c-3227-a859-830c7ff079de",
                                        "entry_id": "8acd7214-70a7-309c-908d-d6d232eb80c8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to any form of Satanism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
